    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banshee Bash</strong> is a fast-paced local multiplayer party royale! Team up or go solo in chaotic free-for-all battles. Collect spell books to expand your arsenal and grab potion bottles to stay in the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Choose your favorite fighter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Unique Levels</strong> \u2013 Battle across diverse arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Cosmetics</strong> \u2013 Customize your character with stylish rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 8 Players</strong> \u2013 Bring the whole party! <i>(Windows currently limits controller connections to 4, but bots can fill the rest).</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to brawl in <strong>Banshee Bash</strong> \u2013 where the magic is wild, and the competition is fierce!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banshee Bash</strong> is a fast-paced local multiplayer party royale! Team up or go solo in chaotic free-for-all battles. Collect spell books to expand your arsenal and grab potion bottles to stay in the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Choose your favorite fighter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Unique Levels</strong> \u2013 Battle across diverse arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Cosmetics</strong> \u2013 Customize your character with stylish rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 8 Players</strong> \u2013 Bring the whole party! <i>(Windows currently limits controller connections to 4, but bots can fill the rest).</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to brawl in <strong>Banshee Bash</strong> \u2013 where the magic is wild, and the competition is fierce!</p>",
    "short_description": "Banshee Bash is a local-multiplayer party game. Fight with up to 3 friends (or add bots) to battle as a team, or in an epic free-for-all. Collect mana and learn spells to cast your way to victory! Games are quick, and will allow you to level up for unlockable cosmetics to add some flair!",
